    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchant Simulator<strong>.\u00a0</strong>It seems simple enough \u2014 <i>buy low, sell high</i>. But in this world, almost everyone\u2019s out to swindle each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools to inspect items, haggle with customers, and build your reputation.<br>As a merchant, you can also deceive \u2014 conceal flaws and greatly exaggerate an item\u2019s value using tools, enchantments, or potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every action has consequences. Your choices shape not only your reputation, but also the fates of those you trade with.</p>",
